  "source_fixes": [
    "The Tube methods use their real receiver rather than the inert EmptyWarp layout. Plot owns the Tube at 0x384 and the point cursor at 0x3C8.",
    "Both phase factories use an explicit spawn record with the same plot pointer and set entry. The actor IDs and set index offsets remain 0x200 and 0x1FF.",
    "The Type 1 factory and constructor use native C++ allocation, base construction, virtual set-data dispatch and typed member initialization. Both live phase instances are typed across callers.",
    "Eight linker labels change with the real C++ owners or signatures. The existing routine names and symbol addresses are retained."
  ],
